# Machine Tooltips
tooltip.advancedsorter.cobble_generator.desc=Generates cobblestone automatically
tooltip.advancedsorter.cobble_generator.details=Requires water and lava. Produces cobblestone for your automation needs.

tooltip.advancedsorter.crucible.desc=Melts cobblestone into lava
tooltip.advancedsorter.crucible.details=Consumes 1000 RF per cobblestone. 4 cobblestones = 1 bucket of lava.

tooltip.advancedsorter.crusher.desc=Crushes materials
tooltip.advancedsorter.crusher.details=Doubles ore output. Crushes Cobblestone to Gravel, and Gravel to Sand.

tooltip.advancedsorter.washer.desc=Washes sand and concrete powder
tooltip.advancedsorter.washer.details=Converts Sand to Clay, Concrete Powder to Concrete. Uses 200 RF and 250mB water per operation.

tooltip.advancedsorter.obsidian_generator.desc=Generates obsidian automatically
tooltip.advancedsorter.obsidian_generator.details=Requires water and lava. Produces obsidian safely.

tooltip.advancedsorter.universal_charger.desc=Charges items in player inventory
tooltip.advancedsorter.universal_charger.details=Stand on it to charge energy items. Supports RF/FE, Mekanism Joules, fluids and gases.

tooltip.advancedsorter.deconstructor.desc=Breaks down items into components
tooltip.advancedsorter.deconstructor.details=Reverse-crafts items back to their ingredients.

tooltip.advancedsorter.auto_repairer.desc=Automatically repairs damaged items
tooltip.advancedsorter.auto_repairer.details=Uses RF energy to repair tools and armor.

tooltip.advancedsorter.ammo_press.desc=Crafts ammunition for Immersive Engineering
tooltip.advancedsorter.ammo_press.details=Automates bullet crafting. Requires IE installed.

tooltip.advancedsorter.atmospheric_stabilizer.desc=Stabilizes weather and time
tooltip.advancedsorter.atmospheric_stabilizer.details=Controls weather conditions in the area. High energy consumption.

tooltip.advancedsorter.energy_converter.desc=Converts energy between different systems
tooltip.advancedsorter.energy_converter.details=Lossless conversion: RF/FE, Mekanism Joules, IC2 EU. 1 RF = 2.5 J = 0.25 EU.

tile.smart_router.name=Smart Router
tooltip.advancedsorter.smart_router.desc=Routes items based on frequency rules
tooltip.advancedsorter.smart_router.details=Define specific frequencies for specific items. Non-matching items stay in buffer.

tooltip.advancedsorter.flint_maker.desc=Turns Gravel into Flint
tooltip.advancedsorter.flint_maker.details=Consumes 400 RF to convert Gravel into Flint efficiently.

tooltip.advancedsorter.enchantment_extractor.desc=Extracts enchantments from items
tooltip.advancedsorter.enchantment_extractor.details=Moves enchantments from tools/armor onto Books.

tooltip.advancedsorter.xp_vacuum.desc=Collects XP orbs from the area
tooltip.advancedsorter.xp_vacuum.details=Sucks up experience orbs in a wide radius and stores liquid XP.

tooltip.advancedsorter.block_breaker.desc=Breaks blocks in front of it
tooltip.advancedsorter.block_breaker.details=Simulates a pickaxe breaking the block. Supports fortune/silk touch via upgrades.

tooltip.advancedsorter.block_placer.desc=Places blocks
tooltip.advancedsorter.block_placer.details=Places blocks from its inventory into the world.

tooltip.advancedsorter.mob_grinder.desc=Kills mobs in front
tooltip.advancedsorter.mob_grinder.details=Deals damage to mobs in a specific area and collects the drops.

tooltip.advancedsorter.trash_can.desc=Voids items, fluids, and energy
tooltip.advancedsorter.trash_can.details=Permanently deletes anything inserted into it. Useful for overflow management.

tooltip.advancedsorter.auto_fisher.desc=Automatically catches fish
tooltip.advancedsorter.auto_fisher.details=Requires water source and energy. Generates fish and treasure.

tooltip.advancedsorter.void_miner.desc=Generates ores from nothing
tooltip.advancedsorter.void_miner.details=Uses massive amounts of energy (1000 RF/t) to generate ores from the void.
